# Shared recipe of the device-neutral Lumen OS updater, read by
# tools/devices/assemble_app.py. Rule: every device that ships it keeps a byte copy of this file as
# devices/<codename>/app/LumenUpdater.layers (apps/LumenUpdater/test/ota/run.sh checks that the copies are
# identical); the device copy is the one assembled.
# The updater is the shared module apps/core/lumen-updater plus the neutral UpdateTarget of apps/LumenUpdater (every
# fact from the image's ro.lumen.ota.* properties) with its update_engine manifest (the Z9X recipe takes the same file).
app       LumenUpdater
# the shared texts (apps/core/lumen-common-strings): every text two places show, once
module    lumen-common-strings
module    lumen-stats
# the Lumen icon set (apps/core/lumen-icons, its R class named in the top layer R_EXTRA_PACKAGES)
module    lumen-icons
# the XGIMI set update_engine copies, checked before an install (apps/core/lumen-fwcopy, one with the installer)
module    lumen-fwcopy
# the QR codes of the update screen (apps/core/lumen-qr)
module    lumen-qr
# the parallel resumable download of the OTA zip, one with Lumen Installer (apps/core/lumen-download)
module    lumen-download
module    lumen-updater
top       apps/LumenUpdater
# never part of an app tree: build output, APKs, notes
skip      build/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md tools/ .DS_Store BUILD_VERSION
